  "which_floor_the_price_is_against": "`times_this_book` prices the remedy against the two legs' summed variance; `times_this_book_on_the_published_floor` prices it against `undecomposed_sd_gbp`, which is the +- figure the page states. They differ by exactly the reconciliation ratio's distance from 1.0, so the second is the larger whenever the legs undershoot the whole -- and it is the one to quote, because the bound a reader is shown is the one the remedy has to bring under the contrast.",
